    "question": {
      ":question/id": "c704cde6-88e6-532d-86c2-860c5606770a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Express $\\cos(x+180^\\circ)$ in terms of $\\sin x$ or $\\cos x$.\n\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use $\\cos(u+v)=\\cos u\\cos v-\\sin u\\sin v$ with $u=x$ and $v=180^\\circ$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\cos(x+180^\\circ)&=\\cos x\\cos 180^\\circ-\\sin x\\sin 180^\\circ\\\\\n&=\\cos x\\left(-1\\right)-\\sin x\\left(0\\right)\\\\\n&=-\\cos x\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
